1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,235
Ek sawaal hai.

2
00:00:01,685 --> 00:00:03,466
Jis sabhyata ne duniya ko Ved,

3
00:00:03,486 --> 00:00:04,294
Upanishad,

4
00:00:04,314 --> 00:00:05,822
Gita aur Darshan diye

5
00:00:05,872 --> 00:00:08,581
aaj uske log apne hi dharm ko kitna jaante hain?

6
00:00:08,981 --> 00:00:10,133
Humne hamle dekhe.

7
00:00:10,153 --> 00:00:11,221
Mandir toote.

8
00:00:11,241 --> 00:00:13,802
Nalanda jaise vidya-kendra ujad gaye.

9
00:00:14,002 --> 00:00:15,484
Phir 1835:

10
00:00:15,504 --> 00:00:21,352
British raj ne sarkari paisa Sanskrit aur paramparik shiksha se hata kar English shiksha par laga diya.

11
00:00:21,553 --> 00:00:24,670
Aur hum dheere-dheere apne hi gyaan se door hote gaye.

12
00:00:25,069 --> 00:00:27,884
Aaj koi bina padhe hamare granthon ko myth keh deta hai

13
00:00:27,935 --> 00:00:29,122
aur koi bina samjhe,

14
00:00:29,142 --> 00:00:30,285
bina sawaal kiye,

15
00:00:30,305 --> 00:00:31,694
bas rasmein nibhata hai.

16
00:00:31,994 --> 00:00:33,196
Ram ka naam lete hain,

17
00:00:33,216 --> 00:00:35,159
par unke aadarsh bhool jaate hain.

18
00:00:35,308 --> 00:00:36,560
Gita ghar mein hai,

19
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:38,160
par Karmayog jeevan mein nahi.

20
00:00:38,511 --> 00:00:39,023
Bas.

21
00:00:39,822 --> 00:00:40,870
Na andh-bhakti.

22
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,053
Na andh-virodh.

23
00:00:42,203 --> 00:00:42,687
Padho.

24
00:00:42,707 --> 00:00:43,724
Sawaal karo.

25
00:00:43,744 --> 00:00:44,588
Samjho.

26
00:00:44,608 --> 00:00:45,482
Aur jiyo.

27
00:00:45,783 --> 00:00:49,184
Isi sankalp ke saath shuru hoti hai SATYA JANTA PARTY.

28
00:00:49,383 --> 00:00:50,361
Na paisa chahiye,

29
00:00:50,381 --> 00:00:51,592
na koi bada vaada.

30
00:00:51,642 --> 00:00:52,789
Bas ek request:

31
00:00:52,809 --> 00:00:53,736
follow kijiye.

32
00:00:54,036 --> 00:00:55,044
Satya ko jaano.

33
00:00:55,064 --> 00:00:56,145
Satya ko jiyo.

34
00:00:56,345 --> 00:00:57,043
Jai Hind.

35
00:00:57,063 --> 00:00:58,613
Jai Sanatan.
